  "description": "Monday is an elegant script font featuring beautiful character variations. This font combines a script style with a modern touch, carefully designed for an elegant look.\nThis font is visually appealing, clean, feminine, and easy to read thanks to its luxurious letter connections. The elegant style is perfect for a variety of formal uses, including invitations, labels, restaurant menus, logos, fashion, makeup, stationery, novels, magazines, books, greeting and wedding cards, packaging, and all types of advertising.\nContains the complete set:\nUppercase Letters – Lowercase Letters – Alternate Letters – Numbers, Punctuation – Font Style – Multilingual Support.",
